{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出《瑜伽》三十五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此應為說佛菩薩所能修學之能證得故令發心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "前約自見或聞\n他佛及菩薩神變功德，據他見佛餘說者，此約依教聞已生信"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如其次第釋上四因"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此說不發心菩薩過"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂能善護不作諸惡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有六大"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此所應親近善友相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼十種行一一應說之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此言流至第十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "論釋云：為遠離身口意業一切惡行，發大精進也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "論云：以化一切眾生，令學彼處，不虛分別者，以不著\n諸法故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "論云：以遠離增\n愛故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "論云：以平等教化一切眾\n生故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "論云：以如實知心，便隨相應說法故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "論云：以證實法，不三界故，又離虛妄法故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廣說如常也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "准三歸亦一日一夜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並各三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其受者答言能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "皆准可說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如觀音等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "教答"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "准前隨從稱名，應云某甲能持"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "准檀說之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "教答能持。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘八三惡道文同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次思十善所有利益，廣如《十地》、《仁王》、《彌勒問論》等說"}
