{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下略不具善知識言。准此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂似\n母等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂施見心語智并藏隱六方離十四也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三唱"}
